[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 180.869, "timestamp": "00:03:00", "text": "树。你是不是遇到网络延迟了？塞莱斯特。艾玛，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 183.11, "timestamp": "00:03:03", "text": "这是一只蜥蜴。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 185.03, "timestamp": "00:03:05", "text": "我的意思是，如果你遇到故障，你还想怎样？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 186.869, "timestamp": "00:03:06", "text": "我开始玩《等等，Celeste》是不是卡顿了？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 188.63, "timestamp": "00:03:08", "text": "决不。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 190.309, "timestamp": "00:03:10", "text": "从很远的地方。我该如何获得"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 193.11, "timestamp": "00:03:13", "text": "我的斧子在吗？我无法评价塞莱斯特。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 194.71, "timestamp": "00:03:14", "text": "哦，但是食人族绝对是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 197.82999999999998, "timestamp": "00:03:17", "text": "滞后。你还指望什么呢，伙计？这"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 206.309, "timestamp": "00:03:26", "text": "嗯。塞莱斯特。是的，女士。开始一个新的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 208.07, "timestamp": "00:03:28", "text": "游说是因为就像很多事情一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 209.43, "timestamp": "00:03:29", "text": "说实话，有点落后。我当时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 212.71, "timestamp": "00:03:32", "text": "黑客入侵兔子，它就消失了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 215.19, "timestamp": "00:03:35", "text": "我的意思是，这是带走你的兔子或者你的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 218.71, "timestamp": "00:03:38", "text": "斧头。在这种情况下，我们应该喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 220.55, "timestamp": "00:03:40", "text": "瞧瞧。我们要去……是吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 222.22899999999998, "timestamp": "00:03:42", "text": "因为我就像在另一边"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 226.149, "timestamp": "00:03:46", "text": "世界？是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 227.75, "timestamp": "00:03:47", "text": "你们正在被隔离。那么，让我们开始吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 231.11, "timestamp": "00:03:51", "text": "接受现实吧。对不起。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 232.39, "timestamp": "00:03:52", "text": "我觉得最好我们先开始"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 233.82999999999998, "timestamp": "00:03:53", "text": "另一个服务器，因为一切都是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 235.91, "timestamp": "00:03:55", "text": "滞后。我们可以保存进度，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 238.07, "timestamp": "00:03:58", "text": "是否转移到其他服务器。"}]